  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase production and income of coffee farmers through training, technical assistance and credit to combat diseases and the effects of climate change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin de Cooperativas de Pequeos Productores de Caf de Nicaragua (CAFENICA) will offer farmers in its member organizations training, technical assistance and credit toward controlling crop diseases and mitigating the effects of climate change. The work will benefit 620 farmers and 3,100 members of their families.</narrative>
  </description>
